#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""krew-mode: GPU occupancy for the crew (lifted whole from the reference install's mode switch, 2026-10-10).

The seams cut on the way in: the flag, hold, state and caps come from $KREW_HOME/krew.yaml `gpu:` (the reference
install's values are the defaults), the engine and voice unit names from $KREW_HOME/services.json rows (`ops`,
`crew`, `voice`), Comfy's folders from the one Comfy location (crew/lib/krew_comfy.py: the Wall's render.json, else
KREW_COMFY_ROOT, else ~/ComfyUI), the kill switches are KREW_* (one
renamed KREW_*), and the Wall's pieces (glass_mode, the Lila plate, the baseline) are absent-ok.

Brains (Standard/Beast) vs Render (Comfy).

Flag: ~/.hermes/krew-gpu-mode  =  render | normal | beast | off
  (not krew-mode.json — that file is the auth policy.)

  krew-mode status
  krew-mode render [turbo|wan|max]
  krew-mode beast
  krew-mode off   # All OS Off — empty GPU, not host poweroff

Render parks ops :8000 (Crissa's composer), keeps crew :8005 Unsloth 27B,
starts Comfy. The kanban team stays on :8005 — Ada, aux vision, goal judge. Do not rewrite lane YAML onto ops (that was the 2026-08-28 leftover
once crew was the park). Both brains + Comfy do not fit (measured 2026-09-05:
ops 38.6G + crew 40.2G + Cosy 10.9G + Comfy starved at 0.5G; live 2026-09-08
ops ~39.4G and crew ~39.8G are peers). Turbo needs 20G. Ada dispatches one
card (`ADA_DISPATCH["render"]`). Crissa and Steward sleep. Crissa limps: Audio8
ear stays, Cosy `lila` if Voice ON, pose bag draws. All OS Off still sleeps
everyone — it has its own roster.

Law (2026-09-05 stall): pin the lane to a *live* 27B. Never to a parked
engine. Canonical Render: crew is live, ops is down; YAML stays pack (crew).
If crew is parked (emergency leftover), pin ops and ops must be up.
Dual-park (both 27Bs down for VRAM, e.g. ltx23) is exclusive — Ada must not
dispatch (caps 0/0, gateway stays down). Dual-park plus workers aimed at a
dead port is the stall.
Normal SIGKILLs Comfy, waits VRAM, restarts ops, wakes Crissa.
Beast parks ops+Comfy and leftover-fits Unsloth Qwen3.8-27B as **crew :8005**.
Cosy TTS and Audio8 STT stay. Voice ON keeps Cosy (mouth), not ops.
Janitor stays up: occupancy flag is SoT; parked probes are
expected-down, not a reason to disable the timer.

Does not touch Audio8, rail-stt, presence, camera, the door stamp, or
krew-janitor.timer.

Ops Render park is systemd stop. Never standing `--enable-sleep-mode` on
ops (CuMem IMA 2026-08-21). Crew L1 `/sleep` stays for Beast/emergency only.
Do not L2. MPS is gone (2026-08-07). Authority: docs/RENDER-OCCUPANCY.md
and docs/DUAL-27B-LANES.md.
"""
