    """The config.yaml whose `kanban:` block the DISPATCHER reads. Ada's while each profile runs a
    gateway of its own; the default profile's once ONE host gateway serves everyone (hermes reads
    the launch profile's block, at boot — rehearsed and read in the source 2026-09-27)."""
